4"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"local_proof_checked","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>；相关定义见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"02137f1993c454ce\" href=\"?note=02137f1993c454ce\" title=\"43-df-lowfortest\">43-df-lowfortest</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"50f8cec2add25f5b\" href=\"?note=50f8cec2add25f5b\" title=\"43-df-lowforml\">43-df-lowforml</a>；固定通用相对测试及非相对测试见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d602113af79aa36d\" href=\"?note=d602113af79aa36d\" title=\"43-thm-ml-universal-test\">43-thm-ml-universal-test</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LowForTest}(A)\\iff\\mathrm{LowForML}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{LowForTest}(A)\\iff\\mathrm{LowForML}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本地证明：测试低性直接保持所有随机点；反向时相对测试交集中的每个点非 A 随机，由低性必非随机，故包含于通用非相对测试交集。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-lowfortest","status":"resolved","id":"02137f1993c454ce","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-lowfortest]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-lowforml","status":"resolved","id":"50f8cec2add25f5b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-lowforml]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-thm-ml-universal-test","status":"resolved","id":"d602113af79aa36d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-thm-ml-universal-test]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-lowfortest","status":"resolved","id":"02137f1993c454ce","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；相关定义见 [[43-df-lowfortest]]、[[43-df-lowforml]]；固定通用相对测试及非相对测试见 [[43-thm-ml-universal-test]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-lowforml","status":"resolved","id":"50f8cec2add25f5b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；相关定义见 [[43-df-lowfortest]]、[[43-df-lowforml]]；固定通用相对测试及非相对测试见 [[43-thm-ml-universal-test]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-thm-ml-universal-test","status":"resolved","id":"d602113af79aa36d","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；相关定义见 [[43-df-lowfortest]]、[[43-df-lowforml]]；固定通用相对测试及非相对测试见 [[43-thm-ml-universal-test]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LowForTest}(A)\\iff\\mathrm{LowForML}(A).","display":true}],"bytes":1214,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-377","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-lowfortest-equiv]] — Martin–Löf 测试低性与随机低性等价"}],"outgoing":["02137f1993c454ce","50f8cec2add25f5b","d602113af79aa36d"]}